.Dd February 25, 2026
.Dt ELF_DEBUG 3
.Os Substrate
.Sh NAME
.Nm elf_section_is_debug ,
.Nm elf_section_is_cfi ,
.Nm elf_section_is_split_dwarf ,
.Nm elf_section_is_compressed_debug ,
.Nm elf_debug_set_compression_hint ,
.Nm elf_debug_get_compression_hint ,
.Nm elf_eh_frame_stats ,
.Nm elf_debug_validate ,
.Nm elf_debug_sort_sections
.Nd debug and unwind helpers for libelfobj
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In elfobj.h
.Ft int
.Fo elf_section_is_debug
.Fa "const elf_section_t *section"
.Fc
.Ft int
.Fo elf_section_is_cfi
.Fa "const elf_section_t *section"
.Fc
.Ft int
.Fo elf_section_is_split_dwarf
.Fa "const elf_section_t *section"
.Fc
.Ft int
.Fo elf_section_is_compressed_debug
.Fa "const elf_section_t *section"
.Fc
.Ft elf_err_t
.Fo elf_debug_set_compression_hint
.Fa "elf_section_t *section"
.Fa "uint32_t ch_type"
.Fa "uint64_t uncompressed_size"
.Fa "uint64_t addralign"
.Fc
.Ft int
.Fo elf_debug_get_compression_hint
.Fa "const elf_section_t *section"
.Fa "uint32_t *ch_type_out"
.Fa "uint64_t *uncompressed_size_out"
.Fa "uint64_t *addralign_out"
.Fc
.Ft elf_err_t
.Fo elf_eh_frame_stats
.Fa "const elf_section_t *section"
.Fa "size_t *cie_count_out"
.Fa "size_t *fde_count_out"
.Fc
.Ft elf_err_t
.Fo elf_debug_validate
.Fa "elfobj_t *obj"
.Fa "char **diagnostics"
.Fc
.Ft elf_err_t
.Fo elf_debug_sort_sections
.Fa "elfobj_t *obj"
.Fc
.Sh DESCRIPTION
These interfaces provide debug/unwind-oriented classification,
validation, and deterministic ordering.
.Pp
.Fn elf_section_is_debug
returns non-zero for DWARF-style debug sections such as
.Pa .debug_*
and
.Pa .zdebug_* .
.Fn elf_section_is_cfi
returns non-zero for CFI containers
.Pq Pa .eh_frame , Pa .eh_frame_hdr , Pa .debug_frame .
.Fn elf_section_is_split_dwarf
detects split DWARF payload sections
.Pq suffixes like Pa .dwo .
.Pp
.Fn elf_debug_set_compression_hint
records compression header metadata and marks the section with
.Dv SHF_COMPRESSED .
.Fn elf_debug_get_compression_hint
returns either explicit hints or parsed on-disk compression header data.
.Pp
.Fn elf_eh_frame_stats
computes CIE/FDE counts for a CFI section.
.Fn elf_debug_validate
extends core validation with debug/CFI structural checks and
debug-relocation cross-reference checks.
.Fn elf_debug_sort_sections
reorders debug/CFI sections deterministically.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
.Fn elf_section_is_debug ,
.Fn elf_section_is_cfi ,
.Fn elf_section_is_split_dwarf ,
and
.Fn elf_section_is_compressed_debug
return 1 when true and 0 otherwise.
.Pp
.Fn elf_debug_get_compression_hint
returns 1 when hint data is available and 0 otherwise.
.Pp
Other functions return
.Dv ELF_OK
on success or an
.Vt elf_err_t
error code.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr elf_section 3 ,
.Xr elf_validate 3 ,
.Xr elfobj 3
